    q_loop_adddmareg           35     44    117    309    693   1461   2997     2.938
    q_loop_adddmareg_sync      70    110    206    398    782   1550   3086     2.992
    noise floor: `q_ctrl` spans 7-28 cycles (21) across the burst lengths;
      that is what one raw point can be wrong by.
    form check, ADDDMAREG burst, cascade vs loop where both run:
             n    cascade       loop  loop-casc
            16         46         35        -11
