            64        112        117         +5
           128        318        309         -9
      -> over n=16..128: cascade 2.429, loop 2.446 cycles per instruction
         (difference +0.018 -- the loop's own back edge is in this, and
         `q_loop_addi` above says how much of it that is)
    out to n=1024:  issuing core 2.938  |  drained 2.992  |  issue-limited baseline 1.122 (`q_loop_addi`)
    backlog in flight when the last .ttinsn returned (cycles of ThCon
