      n=16 +0  n=32 +31  n=64 +54  n=128 +54  n=256 +54  n=512 +54  n=1024 +54  
    marginal cost between adjacent burst lengths:  16->32 0.56  32->64 2.28  64->128 3.00  128->256 3.00  256->512 3.00  512->1024 3.00  
